WEBVTT

00:02:55.338 --> 00:03:01.010
But politics and profits pushed us
in the opposite direction.

00:03:01.677 --> 00:03:05.556
With the support
of Republicans and Democrats,

00:03:05.556 --> 00:03:11.354
today, we lock up men,
we lock up women, and we lock up children.

00:03:12.396 --> 00:03:16.776
But in our past,
I see hope for the future.

00:03:17.818 --> 00:03:23.616
We can take clear steps
toward abolishing immigration prisons.

00:03:26.202 --> 00:03:28.913
Most people think of Ellis Island

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:33.793
as the place that welcomed generations
of newcomers to the United States.